@baseUrl = http://localhost:5045
@memberToken = replace-with-member-jwt
@directorToken = replace-with-director-jwt
@participationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@justificationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### List member absences available for justification
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/faltas?semJustificativa=true
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### List member justification history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/justificativas
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### Submit a justification without an attachment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/justificativas
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=JustificationBoundary

--JustificationBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="faltaId"

{{participationId}}
--JustificationBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="motivo"

SAUDE
--JustificationBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="descricao"

Consulta médica previamente agendada para o mesmo horário do evento, conforme comprovante disponível.
--JustificationBoundary--

### List the director queue
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/justificativas
Authorization: Bearer {{directorToken}}

### Approve a pending justification
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/justificativas/{{justificationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{directorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "APROVADA"
}

### Reject a pending justification
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/justificativas/{{justificationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{directorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "REJEITADA"
}
